# EAS Build archives the whole monorepo (this is the git root, mobile/ is a
# subdirectory), but the Android app only needs mobile/ plus the root config
# files Expo looks for. Everything below is backend/ML project content that
# has nothing to do with the app build — excluding it cuts the upload from
# ~94MB to a few MB, which also makes the upload far less likely to drop on a
# flaky connection.
Datasets/
runs/
backend/
docs/
WEBSITE/
.venv/
.venv-train/
*.pt
*.joblib
.git/
